usage: RUN_REPRO.py [-h] --source SOURCE --node-bin NODE_BIN
                    --node-modules NODE_MODULES --output OUTPUT [--cpu CPU]
                    [--source-manifest SOURCE_MANIFEST]
                    [--base-freeze BASE_FREEZE]

CPU-only v2 incremental split API replay; creates only a fresh private copy.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source SOURCE
  --node-bin NODE_BIN
  --node-modules NODE_MODULES
  --output OUTPUT
  --cpu CPU
  --source-manifest SOURCE_MANIFEST
                        Actual copied-source REPLAY.json with sourceClosure,
                        or SOURCE_CLOSURE.json with files
  --base-freeze BASE_FREEZE
                        Immutable v2 target freeze; defaults to the hash-bound
                        reference
